  "body": "* Brand-new single-level home with contemporary finishes throughout\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flowing to the outdoor deck\r\n* Master suite with ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and direct deck access\r\n* Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n* Additional family area providing flexibility for relaxation or everyday living\r\n* Flat, easy-care backyard ideal for year-round entertaining\r\n\r\nFreshly built and ready to welcome its first owners, this modern home combines clean architectural lines with thoughtfully designed interiors and practical living spaces.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a natural gathering place for everyday life. The contemporary kitchen features warm timber cabinetry, a spacious island and ample storage, creating a stylish and practical space for everyday living. Large sliding doors extend the living space onto the outdoor deck - ideal for relaxed evenings, weekend entertaining or simply enjoying the fresh air.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, with the master bedroom offering the added convenience of a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite with shower. The family bathroom is equally well considered, featuring both a separate shower and a bathtub. An additional family area creates valuable flexibility, whether for a quiet retreat, a second sitting space or somewhere to unwind.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Orewa Beach, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, schools and motorway access, this home delivers coastal living with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWith its brand-new appeal, modern finishes and functional layout, this is an excellent opportunity to secure a fresh start in Orewa. Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing or looking for a contemporary home to enjoy, 33 Tamaota Terrace is ready for you to make it your own.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
